text: >-
  The Last 60 Days of Charlie Kirk

  July 11

  Kirk hosts Tucker Carlson

  at TPUSA Student Action

  Summit, allowing him to

  criticize Israel and claim

  Jeffrey Epstein worked

  Tor Israell intelligence.

  August 5

  Kirk attends Hamptons

  meeting with pro-israel

  donor Bill Ackman, who

  confronts him over

  platforming Tucker.

  September 8

  Kirk loses a $2 million

  annual donor after

  reusing to cancel

  Tucker Carlson.

  September 9

  Final interview with Ben

  Shapiro, Kirk presses

  tougher questions on

  Israel.

  July 24

  Kirk posts widely viewed

  YouTube roundtable

  with Gen Z conservative

  students questioning US

  aid to Israel.

  August 6

  On Megyn Kelly Show,

  Kirk calls pressure from

  pro-Israel groups

  repulsive and alienating.

  "They are attacking my

  character!"

  August 20

  Kirk texts Jewish

  donors are "playing into

  all the stereotypes

  and

  has "no choice but to

  leave the pro-Israel

  cause."

  September 10

  Charlie Kirk is

  assassinated at Utah

  Valley University while

  speaking at a TPUSA

  event.

  No recordings or statements of support for Israel exist of Kirk within the
  last 60 days.

  @freddymacusa
